/*!
 * \mainpage
 *
 * \par What Is It?
 *
 * timertt (Timer Thread Template) is a simple, lightweight and header-only
 * implementation of timer thread classes based only on C++11 standard library.
 * timertt supports several types of timer handling mechanisms (timer list,
 * timer wheel, timer heap).
 *
 * \par Where To Get And How To Use
 *
 * Please see this section: \ref timertt_getting_started.
 *
 * \par Timer Mechanisms
 *
 * For more information about various types of timer mechanisms and their
 * features please the this section: \ref timertt_timer_mechanisms.
 *
 * \par Version History
 *
 * Version history of timertt library is described here: \ref timertt_version.
 *
 * \par License
 *
 * The timertt is distributed under 3-clause BSD-license:
 * \verbinclude LICENSE
 */

